                    RowBox[{"Break", "[", "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"jj", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "kdPairs", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}],
                    ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                   RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", ",", "\"\<Sum(\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                   RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                RowBox[{"(*", 
                 RowBox[{"fallback", " ", "to", " ", "sum", 
                  RowBox[{"(", 
                   RowBox[{"...", ",", "3"}], ")"}], " ", "when", " ", 
                  "appropriate"}], "*)"}], 
                RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "args", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], "&&", 
                   RowBox[{"StringMatchQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"args", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"RegularExpression", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<\\\\s*\>\"", "<>", "var", "<>", "\"\<\\\\s*\>\""}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"new", "=", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<sum(\>\"", "<>", "inner", "<>", "\"\<,3)\>\""}]}], 
                   ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                   RowBox[{"s2", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringReplacePart", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", ",", "new", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"p", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"idx", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "args", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], "&&", 
                    RowBox[{"StringMatchQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Last", "[", "args", "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"RegularExpression", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<\\\\s*\>\"", "<>", "var", "<>", "\"\<\\\\s*\>\""}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"inner", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"Riffle", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Most", "[", "args", "]"}], ",", "\"\<,\>\""}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"new", "=", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<sum(\>\"", "<>", "inner", "<>", "\"\<,3)\>\""}]}], 
                    ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"StringReplacePart", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s2", ",", "new", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"p", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"idx", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Delete", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"posList", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}],
                ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
                 RowBox[{"Delete", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"posList", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                
                RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"posList", "=", 
              RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[", 
               RowBox[{"s2", ",", "\"\<Sum(\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "]"}], 
          ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "s2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"(*", 
       RowBox[{"end", " ", "replaceSum"}], "*)"}], 
      RowBox[{"str", "=", 
       RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
        RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<ms\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"str", "=", 
       RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
        RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<mb\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"str", "=", 
       RowBox[{"replaceSum", "[", 
        RowBox[{"str", ",", "\"\<m\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"str", "=", 
       RowBox[{"StringReplace", "[", 
        RowBox[{"str", ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<S(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<S\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Sp(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Sp\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Spp(ms)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Spp\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Bs(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bs\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Bsp(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bsp\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Bspp(mb)\>\"", "->", "\"\<Bspp\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<KroneckerDelta(kp,kp)\>\"", "->", "\"\<1\>\""}]}], 
          "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"StringTrim", "[", "str", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "\n"}]], "Input",
